# The deployed site is a small set of self-contained pages: every capture is
# embedded as a data URI, so none of the source material needs to be served.
# Upload only the pages (and vercel.json, which Vercel reads from the root).
#
# This is a whitelist. Re-including a file inside an excluded directory needs
# the directory itself re-included first, then its contents excluded, then the
# file re-included — which is why every lesson folder gets the same three lines.
*
# 01 · research and benchmark
!01-research
01-research/*
!01-research/research.html
# 02 · personas and JTBD
!02-personas-jtbd
02-personas-jtbd/*
!02-personas-jtbd/personas.html
# 03 · information architecture
!03-information-architecture
03-information-architecture/*
!03-information-architecture/ia.html
# 04 · wireframes, and the clickable prototypes: one folder per case
!04-wireframes
04-wireframes/*
!04-wireframes/pages
!04-wireframes/pages/*
!04-wireframes/prototypes
!04-wireframes/prototypes/*
!04-wireframes/prototypes/*/*
# 05 · tone of voice and microcopy
!05-tone-of-voice
05-tone-of-voice/*
!05-tone-of-voice/voice.html
!vercel.json
